From ee747d88ee2c4aa4158ac1022579dd907299882c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: obaidr1 <147771377+obaidr1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 21:43:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add F3 stats / F4 texture inspector overlay; keep
 DuckStation pack tracking across savestates

- psx_debug_overlay: F3 shows frame timing, draw counts, HD query/match rates
  and tracked uploads (including large uploads lost to partial writes); F4
  picks the textured draw under the mouse and explains its replacement (page,
  CLUT, UV, matched file or why none). Also reachable over the debug server
  (debug_overlay command) for headless runs.
- duckstation_texture_pack: explain/tracking summary hooks for the overlay,
  big-drop accounting, and tracking state save/load so a restored savestate
  matches replacements without waiting for the game to re-upload (Beetle
  packs already did this).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
